       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAY-INCOMP.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLAY-INCOMP-PROOFS.
           05  WS-VOLUME-LOCK-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GENUS-OK                 PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COLLISION-BOUNDS-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HOMOTOPY-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HOMOTOPY-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLAY-INCOMP-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PIC-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PIC-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-VOLUME-AND-GENUS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-BOUNDS-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PIC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-VOLUME-AND-GENUS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VOLUME-LOCK-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GENUS-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-BOUNDS-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COLLISION-BOUNDS-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HOMOTOPY-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PIC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-VOLUME-LOCK-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GENUS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-COLLISION-BOUNDS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HOMOTOPY-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-HOMOTOPY-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PIC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PIC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PIC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PIC-CODE.
